        <mxCell id="s1-arckit-32" value='&lt;span style="font-family:IBM Plex Mono;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#111111;"&gt;ArcKit core 6.18 · unmodified&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:IBM Plex Sans;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#5C5C5C;"&gt;  — GovKit reaches it only through &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:IBM Plex Mono;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#5C5C5C;"&gt;.arckit/templates-custom/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:IBM Plex Sans;font-size:13px;font-weight:400;color:#5C5C5C;"&gt; and recipes. Its artefacts (REQ · HLDR · DLDR · ADR · SECD · DEVOPS · OPS · DATA) are the evidence; hand-offs go to /arckit:adr and /arckit:risk.&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=24;spacingRight=16;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DIBM%2BPlex%2BSans%3A300%2C400%2C500%2C600;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="64" y="784" width="1376" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
